    {
      "id": "clm:963f5e8adb340490aeaf3188d770fadaaeac853391900f00f03b959f80c60a24",
      "text": "The documented schema prompts cover excessive collections, large arrays, oversized documents, and excessive indexes; another prompt suggests embedding related data when $lookup is used. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/compass/manage-data/performance-insights.md",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:c9e507db01d142baaadbc00a44aadaff7386630adeacf7ddff47892b7a1ada6b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:4ef0778eb7b72a5558c828ad8792feb2710b1b1d2750766b03dc9bbfb13d7800",
      "text": "Review suggestions against actual application needs before changing a schema; an advised index should support frequently used queries. MongoDB recommends applying the guidance early because production schema changes can be harder. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/compass/manage-data/performance-insights.md",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:c01e618edbbd51cbd2c38e750f7055cbe1ab9b4e059e84261f7cd51be26e494c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:e3e1862975c4cc44a4e9aaca4a853f366cd95ed515d905ac8ccc6f674aba4707",
      "text": "A query or aggregation executed without an index triggers guidance to add a supporting index. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/compass/manage-data/performance-insights.md",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:81e864c9b805e8f91bb36f0c410448151cef269cbb4c29aa7d3e4d83b8ec5e81"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:038b1936eeaddaf3da10538b715969317e10144e37cc4c38d58582a1e359047b",
      "text": "Other documented triggers include excessive collections, array elements, document size, or indexes; the page supplies no numeric detection thresholds. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/compass/manage-data/performance-insights.md",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:c9e507db01d142baaadbc00a44aadaff7386630adeacf7ddff47892b7a1ada6b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:49daa88935a4d4e53d196a03eb9155dd24d3eaba6862fa9b59bce99408ec6a3f",
      "text": "TECHBETA labels explain-plan visualization as Performance Insights; this terminology differs from MongoDB\u2019s dedicated recommendation-feature documentation. (medium confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://techbeta.org/software/mongodb-compass/",
      "also": [
