    {
      "id": "clm:e20b83b2aee80de95ee6f4e3e066271ea5f18a2d2341ef80954b5bdbda59af42",
      "text": "Documented query prompts recommend indexing unindexed operations and considering Atlas Search for $text or $regex queries; 2023 release notes also record these insight types. (high confidence)",
